{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Live for Happy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Happy</strong> is a virtual cat who lives his own life, even when you're not playing. He's always running, 24/7, even when your PC is off or the game is closed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From time to time, Happy has a need. He might want to <i>eat</i>, <i>clean himself</i>, <i>play</i>, <i>chat</i>, or <i>sleep</i>. It's your job to respond !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do the right action at the right time</strong>\u00a0to earn <strong><u>care points</u></strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Too slow</strong>, or the wrong choice ? You'll lose points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Happy won't wait forever.</i>\u00a0He needs love, and attention. Leave him alone too long, and you'll miss his needs... and lose a lot of points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your goal: get the highest attention score possible !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A global leaderboard will show if you're truly the best at making Happy happy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cat that lives continuously, even offline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute, varied needs to fulfill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive actions, Happy talks and reacts in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Occasional deals with benefits and consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online leaderboard to prove your dedication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adaptive UI, perfect to keep in a corner while multitasking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Happy Pet</strong>\u00a0is light, cute, and strangely addictive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let it live on your screen... and make sure <strong>Happy</strong>\u00a0stays happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753250?t=1747758531","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3753250?t=1747758531","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753250/7ad4e505dc17b843928513e33a71f738c082b315/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1747758531","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753250/7ad4e505dc17b843928513e33a71f738c082b315/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1747758531","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Live for Happy.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Happy</strong> is a virtual cat who lives his own life, even when you're not playing. He's always running, 24/7, even when your PC is off or the game is closed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">From time to time, Happy has a need. He might want to <i>eat</i>, <i>clean himself</i>, <i>play</i>, <i>chat</i>, or <i>sleep</i>. It's your job to respond !</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Do the right action at the right time</strong>\u00a0to earn <strong><u>care points</u></strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Too slow</strong>, or the wrong choice ? You'll lose points.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Happy won't wait forever.</i>\u00a0He needs love, and attention. Leave him alone too long, and you'll miss his needs... and lose a lot of points.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Your goal: get the highest attention score possible !</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A global leaderboard will show if you're truly the best at making Happy happy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Key Features :</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A cat that lives continuously, even offline</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Cute, varied needs to fulfill</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Interactive actions, Happy talks and reacts in real time</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Occasional deals with benefits and consequences</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Online leaderboard to prove your dedication</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Adaptive UI, perfect to keep in a corner while multitasking</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Happy Pet</strong>\u00a0is light, cute, and strangely addictive.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Let it live on your screen... and make sure <strong>Happy</strong>\u00a0stays happy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p>","developers":["Eragone"],"dlc":[3756100],"ext_user_account_notice":"GDevelop ","genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3753250/ab7babe6ef8c5f243ecd3d824000aa44f1b11b60/header.jpg?t=1747758531","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 18.04, SteamOS, or any recent Linux distribution<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Any basic processor (even single-core)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Works with almost any recent or integrated graphics card<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> Basic built-in sound card<br></li><li><strong>VR Support:</strong> Not supported<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Uses technology similar to a web browser. Runs well on most Linux systems, including the Steam Deck.</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257142262,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142262/movie480.mp4?t=1747756490","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257142262/movie_max.mp4?t=1